  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!-- 3D Model --><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b394497391ae4e5f9ae7f2bf059b8eee/Jet_Engine_Model_Components_Kit_-_MH006_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a></p>\n<p></p>\n<!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\nThe <strong>Jet Engine Model Components Kit</strong> contains all the necessary hardware components for assembling an <strong>Engine Model</strong>. To complete the assembly for an entirely functional piece, users also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Creator</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Model Link</b></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第三行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">3D Printable Jet Engine</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">CATIAV5FTW</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/13806\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">3D Printable Jet Engine</a></span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第四行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">3d Printable Turbojet Engine</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributed